cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite a figure from these working documents, please cite this deposit."
title: "psrtype-arbeidsdokumenter — working documents behind psrtype-samfyring and kapregister"
abstract: >-
  Supplementary working documents for two preregistered measurements of
  production-type labelling in the ENTSO-E Transparency Platform. These are the
  files that carry figures cited in the accompanying manuscripts but that are not
  part of either frozen dataset: the A75 reconciliation report with its control
  categories, the Danish coal/biomass time series and unit attribution, the
  Finnish plant-heterogeneity closure, the schema audit of parallel TimeSeries,
  the per-zone effect computation, the cross-product consistency test, the two
  adjudication printouts before and after the A03 step-curve correction, and the
  five scripts that produce those numbers. Deposited unchanged except that local
  file paths were replaced with relative names. Raw XML is not included; it is
  re-fetchable from the ENTSO-E API and is too large to archive here.
